diff --git a/documentation/embedding.md b/documentation/embedding.md
index 33a6a2d9..843c9afc 100644
--- a/documentation/embedding.md
+++ b/documentation/embedding.md
@@ -593,3 +593,9 @@ For fullscreen to work inside an iframe, include `allowfullscreen` or
 
 Without iframe fullscreen permission, users hear "Fullscreen is not available"
 when they try to enter fullscreen mode.
+
+The camera pointer (point at a DOT Pad or a printed map) needs the camera
+inside the iframe, so the generated snippet also carries
+`allow="camera; fullscreen"`. Without `camera` the browser refuses the camera
+and Audiom says so; everything else keeps working. Video is processed on the
+device and never leaves the browser.
